==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Medu-san]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Raynard]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Since over half of the enemies here can create [[Surge Attack]]s, dedicating a significant portion of your lineup to [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge Immune Cats]] is a pretty good idea. The Owlbrows are not a very significant threat as long as you have at least one Surge Immune meatshield, which you should by this point.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]]/[[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] - Surge Immune meatshields obviously perform well on a Surge-centric level.
*[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] - Since there are pauses between the Surges Medu-san creates, Jelly Dumpling has many opportunities to sneak in an attack and deal huge damage to the enemies, which is especially useful for the Owlbrows and Raynard.
*[[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] - Courier performs decently well here, since their speed and piercing range allow them to sneak in attacks on the Owlbrows. Courier can also kill Raynard with ease as long as he's not hiding behind the enemy base.
*Talented [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon]] - When given Surge Immunity, they perform pretty well as an attacker here, as they outrange everything except Raynard, though Raynard isn't likely to hit them. Other Talents only improve their viability even more.

==Trivia==
*Breathtaking Waves may refer to the [[Surge Attack|Surge]]s created by the [[Sinner Snache]]s, [[Medu-san]] and [[Raynard]], as the Japanese name of the Surge Attack ability (烈波) contains the kanji for "wave" (波).

